# Casey Jones's enters trigger is on the stack when Bot2 answers with Lightning Bolt and kills him (3 toughness). The ability exists independently of its source (CR 113.7a):
# it still resolves, Bot1 draws three cards (5 Mountains to 8, then cleanup discards one to seven), and the delayed discard it sets up (CR 603.7) still happens at Bot1's
# next upkeep on turn 7, taking three more at random. Bot1's hand is all Mountains, so which are taken cannot matter. The graveyard, top first: three Mountains from the
# upkeep, the cleanup Mountain, and Casey Jones at the bottom.

